#. Tag: para
#: commands-palettes.docbook:199
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Vertices</guilabel> drop down box is used to set the amount of "
"vertices (points) in the star."
msgstr "<guilabel></guilabel> ជា ដល់ អ៊ិន្ឈ៍."

#. Tag: para
#: commands-palettes.docbook:202
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Ratio</guilabel> setting defines the shape of the star. A "
"ratio of 0% will create a star with no inner area (when drawing the star, "
"the two lines that make up a star point, overlap). Increasing the ratio will "
"slowly make the star more outlined (the two lines are <quote>pulled apart</"
"quote>). A star with a ratio of 100% is a regular polygon."
msgstr ""
